    "Do not delete seeded/runtime-visible content until its exact storage path is proven.",
    "Do not remove reusable schema, lesson definitions, topic navigation, or creation capability from blank.",
    "Do not encode example images/resources as Base64.",
    "Keep Library explicit-open behavior and session startup isolation.",
    "Use the packaged Afterglow example as the destination for approved Afterglow-owned values/resources."
  ],
  "summaryFindings": [
    "The twelve-topic navigation spine is already shared.",
    "Mind Map currently uses free-form Discovery lanes rather than the structured fields World Map exposes for Foundations and World.",
    "World Map is already partly a review projection, but it still contains authoring/generation controls for World, Character visuals and Previs poster work.",
    "Dialogue, Revision, Industry and Collaboration currently have World Map placeholders only.",
    "Theme, Structure, Previs, Drafting and Responsible AI are derived projections rather than stable shared field models.",
    "Blank project construction is empty by code; Phase 2 must specifically trace and migrate the runtime path that makes Afterglow values visible in the user's apparent blank state."
  ]
